    {
      "id": "approval-grade",
      "file": "skills/kerby/rulebooks/swe/BOOTSTRAP.md",
      "quote": "**Grade ≥ 7:** after the plan, **STOP and get user approval**"
    },
    {
      "id": "protected-branches",
      "file": "skills/kerby/rulebooks/swe/BOOTSTRAP.md",
      "quote": "main, master, dev, develop, staging, release/*, trunk"
    },
    {
      "id": "ladder-low",
      "file": "skills/kerby/rulebooks/swe/workflows/feature.md",
      "quote": "| Low (1–3) | Single file, config, typo | Handle directly. Self-review when done. |"
    },
    {
      "id": "ladder-med",
      "file": "skills/kerby/rulebooks/swe/workflows/feature.md",
      "quote": "| Med (4–6) | Multiple related files, moderate logic | **Plan + Expected Outcomes** (below), then implement. Self-check when done. |"
    },
    {
      "id": "ladder-high",
      "file": "skills/kerby/rulebooks/swe/workflows/feature.md",
      "quote": "| High (7–8) | Multi-file, design decisions, new patterns | **Plan + Expected Outcomes, get user approval before starting.** QA sub-agent when done. |"
    },
    {
      "id": "ladder-critical",
      "file": "skills/kerby/rulebooks/swe/workflows/feature.md",
      "quote": "| Critical (9–10) | Cross-cutting, architectural, breaking | Plan + approval + staged rollout. QA sub-agent when done. |"
    },
    {
      "id": "gates-quick",
      "file": "skills/kerby/rulebooks/swe/references/quality-gates.md",
